1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,470
You think ChatGPT's answer

2
00:00:01,470 --> 00:00:02,306
ends at the last

3
00:00:02,306 --> 00:00:02,993
full stop.

4
00:00:02,993 --> 00:00:03,718
It doesn't.

5
00:00:03,718 --> 00:00:04,401
It ends on a

6
00:00:04,401 --> 00:00:05,429
hidden word you never

7
00:00:05,429 --> 00:00:05,929
see.

8
00:00:06,179 --> 00:00:07,247
It's a special end

9
00:00:07,247 --> 00:00:07,817
token.

10
00:00:07,817 --> 00:00:09,110
Meta's Llama models use

11
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:09,869
this one.

12
00:00:09,869 --> 00:00:10,452
Roll it,

13
00:00:10,452 --> 00:00:11,476
and the app hides

14
00:00:11,476 --> 00:00:12,521
it and stops.

15
00:00:12,771 --> 00:00:13,345
Remember,

16
00:00:13,345 --> 00:00:14,323
every piece is a

17
00:00:14,323 --> 00:00:15,305
weighted roll.

18
00:00:15,305 --> 00:00:16,283
The end token is

19
00:00:16,283 --> 00:00:17,597
always on the menu.

20
00:00:17,597 --> 00:00:18,306
Mid-sentence,

21
00:00:18,306 --> 00:00:19,673
its chance is tiny.

22
00:00:19,923 --> 00:00:21,212
After a finished answer,

23
00:00:21,212 --> 00:00:22,119
it shoots up.

24
00:00:22,119 --> 00:00:23,231
Training did that.

25
00:00:23,231 --> 00:00:24,537
Every example answer ended

26
00:00:24,537 --> 00:00:25,641
with that token.

27
00:00:25,891 --> 00:00:26,838
"So it just knows

28
00:00:26,838 --> 00:00:27,884
when it's done?"

29
00:00:27,884 --> 00:00:28,436
Watch.

30
00:00:28,436 --> 00:00:29,968
Ninety percent says stop.

31
00:00:29,968 --> 00:00:30,958
The roll lands on

32
00:00:30,958 --> 00:00:31,466
"Also".

33
00:00:31,466 --> 00:00:32,674
It keeps going.

34
00:00:32,924 --> 00:00:33,684
And if it never

35
00:00:33,684 --> 00:00:34,527
rolls the end?

36
00:00:34,527 --> 00:00:35,214
The app has a

37
00:00:35,214 --> 00:00:35,905
hard limit.

38
00:00:35,905 --> 00:00:36,774
It cuts the answer

39
00:00:36,774 --> 00:00:37,856
mid-sentence.

40
00:00:38,424 --> 00:00:39,142
So who taught it

41
00:00:39,142 --> 00:00:40,058
what a finished answer

42
00:00:40,058 --> 00:00:41,100
looks like?
